Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0, libnotify4, libgomp1, libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers | vulkan-icd
Description: Free, open-source AI image upscaling
 Scalio enlarges photos and illustrations x2 or x4 with Real-ESRGAN,
 running locally on your own GPU through Vulkan. No account, no
 subscription; images never leave the computer.
